@startuml F5.8-D04-CSV-exportar-disciplinas
title F5.8-D04-CSV — Exportar CSV de disciplinas
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "SubjectController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Exportar
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /academico/disciplinas?format=csv
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT todas do curso
Postgres --> Ctrl: rows
Ctrl --> WebApp: CSV attachment\n(UTF-8 BOM)
WebApp --> Sec: download CSV

@enduml
